---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/city.css';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Cleaning Jobs in Wellington | Apply Once, Be Considered for Work"
  description="Apply once for cleaning jobs in Wellington. Suitable applicants become eligible for office, commercial, and residential work across the capital."
  path="/cleaning-jobs-wellington/"
  ogTitle="Cleaning Jobs in Wellington | Cleaning Jobs NZ"
  ogDescription="Apply once for Spruce-standard cleaning work across Wellington and the greater region."
>
  <Fragment slot="head">
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "WebPage",
    "name": "Cleaning Jobs in Wellington | Cleaning Jobs NZ",
    "description": "Apply once for Spruce-standard cleaning work across Wellington and the greater region. Suitable applicants are considered for residential, commercial, and specialist work allocation.",
    "url": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-wellington/",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-wellington/#webpage",
    "inLanguage": "en-NZ",
    "isPartOf": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#website" },
    "about": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "publisher": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/#organization" },
    "breadcrumb": { "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-wellington/#breadcrumb" }
  }
  </script>
  <script is:inline type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "@id": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-wellington/#breadcrumb",
    "itemListElement": [
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 1,
        "name": "Home",
        "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 2,
        "name": "Cleaning jobs in Wellington",
        "item": "https://cleaningjobs.co.nz/cleaning-jobs-wellington/"
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>
  </Fragment>

  <main id="main">
    <nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
      <div class="wrap">
        <ol>
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li aria-current="page">Cleaning jobs in Wellington</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </nav>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <span class="eyebrow">Wellington</span>
        <h1>Cleaning jobs in Wellington.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Apply once to be considered for Spruce-standard cleaning work across Wellington and the greater region. We review every application individually and contact suitable applicants about a next step.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Apply now <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/how-it-works/">How it works</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="reliable-split">
          <div class="reliable-left">
            <span class="eyebrow">Across the region</span>
            <h2>Cleaning work across Wellington.</h2>
            <p class="callout">Wellington leans heavily toward commercial and office work.</p>
            <p>As the capital, Wellington has a compact, hilly centre packed with government and corporate offices, which drives steady demand for scheduled commercial cleans. Residential work is spread across the surrounding suburbs and the greater region, so where you can be considered depends on the areas you can reach and the hours you can cover.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="tick-panel">
            <div class="tick-list">
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Wellington central, Te Aro and Thorndon</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Western suburbs (Kelburn, Karori)</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Eastern and southern suburbs (Miramar, Kilbirnie, Newtown)</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Northern suburbs (Johnsonville, Tawa)</span></div>
              <div class="tick-row"><span class="check" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l4 4 10-10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span><span class="lbl">Greater Wellington (Lower Hutt, Upper Hutt, Porirua)</span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Work types</span>
          <h2>The cleaning work you could be allocated in Wellington</h2>
          <p>The capital's mix tilts toward offices and commercial sites, with residential work across the hills and valleys. Suitable Spruce-certified cleaners are considered for three broad areas.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="types-groups">
          <div class="tgroup">
            <span class="label">Homes</span>
            <h3>Residential cleaning</h3>
            <p class="blurb">Regular and one-off cleans across Wellington's suburbs and the Hutt Valley, plus end-of-tenancy work in a tight rental market.</p>
            <ul><li>Residential cleaning</li><li>Deep cleaning</li><li>End of tenancy</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tgroup">
            <span class="label">Business</span>
            <h3>Office &amp; commercial</h3>
            <p class="blurb">Strong demand from government and corporate offices in the CBD, plus retail and commercial sites across the region.</p>
            <ul><li>Office cleaning</li><li>Commercial cleaning</li></ul>
          </div>
          <div class="tgroup">
            <span class="label">Specialist</span>
            <h3>Trades-adjacent &amp; add-on</h3>
            <p class="blurb">Builders' and handover cleans, carpet and upholstery support, and window cleaning support.</p>
            <ul><li>Builders &amp; handover cleans</li><li>Carpet &amp; upholstery support</li><li>Window cleaning support</li></ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="types-note">
          Not every work type is available in every part of the region. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification.
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="why-split">
          <div class="why-left">
            <span class="eyebrow">Why apply here</span>
            <h2>One application for cleaning work across the capital.</h2>
            <p>Wellington's centre is small but its work is spread from the waterfront offices to the Hutt and Porirua. Apply once and we keep your details on file, then consider suitable applicants as demand comes up.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="why-panel">
            <div class="why-rows">
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">01</span><div><h3>One place to apply</h3><p>Apply once for Wellington cleaning work instead of role by role.</p></div></div>
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">02</span><div><h3>Built for commercial</h3><p>Onboarding and training to the Spruce standard, which suits the capital's heavy office and commercial demand.</p></div></div>
              <div class="why-row"><span class="n">03</span><div><h3>Matched to your area</h3><p>Considered for work based on your location, transport, availability, and certification.</p></div></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-band" id="apply-cta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Apply for cleaning work in Wellington.</h2>
        <p>Tell us your area, experience, availability, and the type of cleaning work you suit. We'll review your application and contact you if there's a suitable next step.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/apply/">Start application <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
          <a class="btn btn-on-dark" href="/faq/">Read the FAQ</a>
        </div>
        <p class="small-note">Work is not guaranteed. Allocation depends on demand, suitability, availability, and certification.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="block faq-block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Wellington questions</span>
          <h2>Applying in Wellington</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do you cover the Hutt Valley and Porirua?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Yes. Demand spans greater Wellington, so cleaners based in Lower Hutt, Upper Hutt, and Porirua are often well placed for work near them. Apply with your location and we'll know which areas you can cover.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Is there more office work than home work here?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>Often, yes. As the capital, Wellington has heavy office and commercial demand, alongside residential work across the suburbs. We ask which work types you suit in the application.</p></div></details>
          <details class="faq-item"><summary>Do the hills and transport matter?<span class="ico" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></span></summary><div class="answer"><p>They can. Wellington is compact but hilly, and public transport is good in the centre. We ask about your location and transport so we can match you to realistic work.</p></div></details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="block tint">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <span class="eyebrow">Keep exploring</span>
          <h2>More ways into cleaning work</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="related-links">
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-auckland/">Cleaning jobs in Auckland</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-hamilton/">Cleaning jobs in Hamilton</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-tauranga/">Cleaning jobs in Tauranga</a>
          <a href="/cleaning-jobs-no-experience/">No experience? Start here</a>
          <a href="/how-to-become-a-cleaner/">How to become a cleaner in NZ</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
